.TH "OPS\-IMPORT" 1 "" "ops" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ops\-import \- import tasks
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBops import\fR
.SH "GLOBAL OPTIONS"
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
print help
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
say more
.br
repeat to count: \-vvv
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fIstring\fR
when to color (default auto) [auto|always|never]
.SH STDIN
The tasks to import.
.PP
Reads a \fByaml\fR document (\fBTaskList\fR) from standard input. Required.
.SH "EXIT STATUS"
.TP
\fB0\fR
done
.TP
\fB3\fR (unreachable)
the fleet did not answer (retryable)
.SH "SEE ALSO"
\fBops\fR(1)
